## CRITICAL: Read These Files First
Before any work:
1. Read `WORKFLOW.md` for current phase details
2. Read `CLAUDE_INSTRUCTIONS.md` for workflow rules
3. Check `git status` for uncommitted work

## Token Management Rules
User prefers phased execution with STOP commands:
- Execute ONE sub-phase at a time
- Commit after each sub-phase: `git commit -m "Description (Phase X.Y)"`
- Brief confirmations only (1-2 sentences)
- STOP and wait for "continue" command
- Update WORKFLOW.md checkboxes after completion

## Phase 6 Remaining Tasks

### Phase 6.2: Add Wave Dividers (15K tokens) - NEXT
- Add wave SVG dividers between all sections in preview.html and front-page.php
- Sections to separate: Hero→Insurance, Insurance→ABA, ABA→Services, Services→Values, Values→Process, Process→CTA
- Use SVGs from assets/images/decorations/
- Ensure smooth color transitions

