- Replace all emojis (🎯🤝💪🧠🏠📚🌍😊⭐🌱) with custom SVG icons
- Add gradient circle containers
- Use brand colors

### Phase 6.4: Floating Elements (15K tokens)
- Add floating clouds/leaves to hero section
- CSS keyframe animations
- Parallax scroll effects

### Phase 6.5: Scroll Animations (10K tokens)
- Intersection Observer setup
- Fade-up on scroll
- Staggered card animations

### Phase 6.6: Testimonials Section (15K tokens)
- New section after Process
- Carousel with 3 testimonials
- Large quotation marks

### Phase 6.7: Visual Polish (10K tokens)
- Background blob shapes
