## Brand Standards
**Colors:**
- Primary Navy: #1E3A5F (text, headers, buttons)
- Primary Orange: #E8912D (CTAs, accents)
- Golden Yellow: #F5B041 (warm accents)
- Teal Light: #5DADE2 (backgrounds)
- Seafoam Green: #48C9B0 (backgrounds)
- Deep Teal: #1A5276 (footer)
- Cream: #FAF9F6 (main background)

**Typography:**
- Headings: Nunito (400, 500, 600, 700, 800)
- Body: Open Sans (400, 500, 600, 700)

## File Structure
```
assets/
  images/decorations/   ← 21 SVG files (Phase 6.1 ✅)
  css/tailwind.css
  js/main.js, animations.js
dist/
  css/style.min.css     ← Built (22KB) ✅
  js/*.min.js
*.php                   ← WordPress templates
```

## Git Workflow
After each sub-phase:
```bash
git add .
git commit -m "Brief description (Phase X.Y)"
git push origin main
```

## Response Pattern
✅ GOOD: "Added wave dividers between 6 sections. Committed as Phase 6.2."
❌ BAD: "I've added beautiful wave dividers that create smooth organic transitions between each section using the SVG files we created earlier..."

## Build Commands
```bash
npm install          # Install dependencies
npm run dev         # Watch mode
npm run build       # Production build
npm run build:js    # Build JavaScript
```

## Quality Targets
- Visual quality must match aviationaba.com
- Lighthouse Performance: 90+
- Lighthouse Accessibility: 95+
- Perfect mobile responsive
- Smooth 60fps animations

